## 🚀 Instalasi

```lua
-- Paste ke executor lalu Execute
loadstring(game:HttpGet("URL_SCRIPT_KAMU"))()
```

Atau copy-paste langsung isi `FlowStudio_V1.7.lua`.

---

## 🗺️ Koordinat

Koordinat ada di bagian `TPos` dan `Targets` di atas script.

```lua
local TPos = {
    JobHorse     = Vector3.new(13377.90, 149.05,  2997.01), -- Area haybales
    JobConst     = Vector3.new(29274.67, 195.81, -2377.38), -- Area construction
    HaySupply    = Vector3.new(13380.60, 149.04,  2985.09), -- Tumpukan hay
    CemSupply    = Vector3.new(29264.86, 195.81, -2377.06), -- Tumpukan semen
    GasStation   = Vector3.new(-643.71,    8.09,    10.98), -- SPBU
}
```

**Cara update koordinat:**
1. Di game, berdiri di lokasi yang ingin diubah
2. Buka output/console di executor
3. Print: `print(game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character.HumanoidRootPart.Position)`
4. Ganti nilai di script

**Cara tambah kuda/mixer baru:**
```lua
-- Tambahkan Vector3 baru di Targets.Horses atau Targets.Mixers
Targets.Horses = {
    Vector3.new(...), -- Existing
    Vector3.new(...), -- Tambahkan di sini
}
```

---

## 🔧 Konfigurasi Keywords

Jika prompt di game tidak terdeteksi, ubah keywords sesuai text prompt game:

```lua
local HAY_PICKUP  = {"wheat","hay","grab","pick","take","straw","bale","supply"}
local HAY_DELIVER = {"feed","horse","deliver","give","hay","bucket","barn"}
local CEM_PICKUP  = {"cement","bag","grab","pick","take","concrete","supply","get"}
local CEM_DELIVER = {"pour","mixer","deliver","dump","fill","concrete","deposit","cement","add"}
```

**Cara cari keyword yang benar:**
Lihat text di atas prompt saat berdiri dekat objek. Tambahkan kata tersebut (lowercase) ke list yang sesuai.

---

## 🔗 Discord Webhook Setup

1. Buka channel Discord yang diinginkan
2. Edit Channel → Integrations → Webhooks → New Webhook
3. Copy URL → paste ke kolom **Webhook URL** di tab Webhook
4. Untuk ping saat disconnect: isi **Discord ID** (klik kanan nama → Copy ID, developer mode harus aktif)

---

## ⚡ Auto-Execute Setelah Reconnect

1. Isi **Auto-Exec URL** di tab Settings dengan raw URL script kamu
2. Pastikan executor support `writefile` (Synapse X, KRNL, dll.)
3. Script akan ditulis ke `autoexec/flow_autorun.lua` otomatis sebelum reconnect
4. Setelah rejoin, executor akan auto-run script

---

## ❓ Troubleshooting

| Masalah | Solusi |
|---------|--------|
| Prompt tidak ke-fire | Cek keywords — lihat text prompt di game, tambahkan ke list yang sesuai |
| Farm balik ke supply padahal ada item | Nama item di game tidak match dengan `HAY_ITEMS`/`CEM_ITEMS`, tambahkan nama yang benar |
| Auto Reconnect tidak jalan | Coba matikan + nyalakan ulang, pastikan toggle aktif |
| FPS tidak berubah | Executor kamu mungkin tidak support `setfpscap`, gunakan Synapse X atau KRNL |
| ESP tidak muncul | `Highlight` instance mungkin tidak support di versi executor lama |
| Loading stuck | HttpGet ke Fluent timeout — coba lagi atau periksa koneksi |

